## Automated Code Review — REQUEST_CHANGES

**Summary**: The FaUiSso extraction itself is solid — core/CLI flow logic is reused (not forked), stores are the existing abstractions, key slots are byte-identical with the CLI/app, and the option-C tile states match issue #1321's ACs. One blocker: `sso_desktop_flows_io.dart` is selected on mobile too (`dart.library.io` is true on iOS/Android), where the browser hop is a no-op — CodeMie/ChatGPT/AIIN tiles enabled by the one-liner wait out a 5-minute callback timeout with zero user-visible feedback (status is `kDebugMode`-only), so a mobile host adopting the bundle silently ships broken sign-in.

